      "S231:diagram": "coordinateSystem(extent={{-180,-200},{180,200}},preserveAspectRatio=false),graphics={Rectangle(extent={{-178,198},{178,62}},lineColor={0,0,0},fillColor={215,215,215},pattern=LinePattern.None,fillPattern=FillPattern.Solid),Text(textString=\"Find change of the setpoint\",textColor={0,0,255},horizontalAlignment=TextAlignment.Left,extent={{74,196},{174,176}}),Rectangle(extent={{-180,38},{176,-38}},lineColor={0,0,0},fillColor={215,215,215},pattern=LinePattern.None,fillPattern=FillPattern.Solid),Rectangle(extent={{-178,-62},{178,-198}},lineColor={0,0,0},fillColor={215,215,215},pattern=LinePattern.None,fillPattern=FillPattern.Solid),Text(textString=\"Suppression time\",textColor={0,0,255},horizontalAlignment=TextAlignment.Left,extent={{100,40},{168,22}}),Text(textString=\"Check if it has passed suppression time\",textColor={0,0,255},horizontalAlignment=TextAlignment.Left,extent={{16,-174},{158,-200}})}",
      "S231:documentation": "info=<html>\n<p>\nThis sequence checks if there is setpoint change and if the time-based suppression\nhas finished. The implementation is according to the Section 5.1.20 of ASHRAE\nGuideline 36, May 2020.\n</p>\n<p>\nCalculate a time-delay period after any change in setpoint based on the difference\nbetween the controlled variable at the time of the change and the new setpoint. The\ndefault time delay period shall be as follows:\n</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\nFor thermal zone temperature alarms: 18 minutes per &deg;C (10 minutes per &deg;F)\nof difference (<code>chaRat</code>) but no longer than 120 minutes (<code>1800</code>).\n</li>\n<li>\nFor thermal zone temperature cooling requests: 9 minutes per &deg;C (5 minutes per &deg;F)\nof difference (<code>chaRat</code>) but no longer than 30 minutes (<code>1800</code>).\n</li>\n<li>\nFor thermal zone temperature heating requests: 9 minutes per &deg;C (5 minutes per &deg;F)\nof difference (<code>chaRat</code>) but no longer than 30 minutes (<code>1800</code>).\n</li>\n</ol>\n</html>,revisions=<html>\n<ul>\n<li>\nJune 18, 2024, by Antoine Gautier:<br/>\nReplaced <code>hold</code> with <code>pre</code> to break the algebraic loop involving the latch component.\nThis is for\n<a href=\\https://github.com/lbl-srg/modelica-buildings/issues/3883\\>issue 3883</a>.\n</li>\n<li>\nDecember 12, 2023, by Jianjun Hu:<br/>\nReimplemented the check of ignoring the first sampling period.\nThis is for\n<a href=\\https://github.com/lbl-srg/modelica-buildings/issues/3596\\>issue 3596</a>.\n</li>\n<li>\nAugust 1, 2020, by Jianjun Hu:<br/>\nFirst implementation.\n</li>\n</ul>\n</html>",
      "S231:hasInput": [
